    "description": "Banking software connects customer accounts, transactions, financial records, and internal controls. Iranian product documentation illustrates how these responsibilities can be divided among integrated modules, although advertised capabilities do not establish implementation quality.",
    "tags": ["Banking software", "Financial infrastructure", "Iran", "Accounting", "Operational resilience"],
    "status": null,
    "editorial_status": "needs_research",
